Warden and Prisoner System - Network Setup

# To run the warden.c on another machine .
    - Get the IP address of that machine and change the Macro of the prisoner1.c and priosner2.c
    -Then you can run the server / warden file using  gcc warden.c -o server and then ./server
    - after which you can connect both the prisoners.
    - Also the way to disconnect is just by pressing ctrl+c.